WEBVTT

00:00.650 --> 00:02.130
He told me...

00:02.730 --> 00:06.460
that within everyone's hearts 
is an impenetrable territory

00:06.460 --> 00:09.620
that's separate from reality.

00:12.230 --> 00:16.530
No suffering or pain exists there.

00:16.990 --> 00:18.050
It's only...

00:18.520 --> 00:20.790
filled with peace.

00:22.820 --> 00:26.500
I hate the cold reality.

00:27.300 --> 00:30.390
Let's spend all of our days within...

00:30.970 --> 00:33.680
the warm days of our youth forever.

00:36.170 --> 00:43.580
Welcome to the Amarariruku of my heart.

02:15.160 --> 02:21.120
<b><u>Episode 9
</u>Melee, Trembling Fingertips</b>

02:23.000 --> 02:27.780
So that place must be very 
important to Tzveta-chan.

02:28.960 --> 02:32.610
I'm sure the heroes who 
determine how hearts should be

02:32.610 --> 02:34.550
could never understand.

02:36.040 --> 02:37.830
So, Tzveta-chan...

02:38.980 --> 02:43.600
I hope that your dream comes true.

02:45.890 --> 02:49.220
Welcome to Amarariruku.

02:49.820 --> 02:53.630
This is a space completely separated 
from the outside world,

02:53.630 --> 02:56.930
created from my heart.

02:57.980 --> 03:02.860
If this place becomes permanent, 
it will become heaven.

03:03.790 --> 03:06.200
A space created by your heart?

03:09.510 --> 03:10.960
Everyone!

03:11.430 --> 03:14.660
Oh, dear. That's rather unexpected.

03:18.610 --> 03:24.530
I guess normal people can't 
stay conscious within my heart.

03:25.250 --> 03:28.790
I'll have to be a little kinder...

03:28.790 --> 03:31.490
Such needy children.

03:35.820 --> 03:38.470
Get away from Natalia-san!

03:39.090 --> 03:41.030
Kaboom!

03:43.200 --> 03:43.990
Tup!

03:43.990 --> 03:47.210
No, no! You can't get in Tzveta-chan's way!

03:47.560 --> 03:51.590
You guys always get in our way!

03:52.960 --> 03:55.130
Don't be ridiculous...

03:56.290 --> 03:58.670
Is it fun being a hero?

03:58.670 --> 04:00.500
Can you laugh?

04:00.500 --> 04:03.930
You guys always look so mad.

04:03.930 --> 04:08.180
I just want everyone to laugh!

04:08.180 --> 04:10.600
I don't care if I die for that!

04:10.930 --> 04:14.210
In fact, I can die as many times as I need to!

04:14.610 --> 04:15.530
Ta-da!

04:15.880 --> 04:19.640
I'm going to make you laugh now!

04:20.060 --> 04:20.780
Huh?

04:20.780 --> 04:23.280
To start things off...

04:23.450 --> 04:25.790
<i><b>Smack</b></i>

04:23.730 --> 04:25.410
Slapstick!

04:25.910 --> 04:29.790
And then... a Buddy Bomb!

04:30.100 --> 04:31.050
Here!

04:31.790 --> 04:32.790
Wait—

04:36.550 --> 04:38.130
Bwah!

04:38.130 --> 04:39.300
Why, you—

04:40.990 --> 04:41.900
Huh?

04:42.680 --> 04:43.720
<b><i>Bleh</i></b>

04:47.510 --> 04:50.430
Not bad... hero...

04:51.040 --> 04:54.520
You w-win...

04:54.930 --> 04:58.660
Take care of... her...

04:59.030 --> 04:59.950
Urk.

04:59.190 --> 04:59.950
<i>Urk</i>

04:59.950 --> 05:02.820
Huh? "Her"? Who? What?!

05:02.820 --> 05:05.080
JK!

05:07.310 --> 05:11.960
Keh, keh... How'd you like
 my little impromptu skit?

05:12.660 --> 05:17.180
<i>Wh-What's with her? I have 
no idea what she's going to do.</i>

05:19.370 --> 05:25.090
You see, I'm... a magical pocket 
that you can pull anything out of!

05:21.590 --> 05:22.380
<b>Potato Chips</b>

05:25.090 --> 05:30.980
People call me... The Human Toy Box!

05:30.600 --> 05:32.730
<b>Ta-da</b>

05:33.990 --> 05:35.490
JK.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.480
Uh...

05:39.570 --> 05:42.170
Huh? You're not laughing?

05:42.170 --> 05:44.620
Do heroes not know how to laugh?

05:45.360 --> 05:47.330
That was quite amusing, dear.

05:47.330 --> 05:50.250
Really?! Which part did you like the most?!

05:51.080 --> 05:54.630
The monkey. The part where the 
monkey was banging the cymbals.

05:55.410 --> 05:58.250
Excellent taste, Tzveta-chan! 
You actually get it!

05:58.250 --> 06:02.290
Ook, ook, ook! Ook, ook, ook!

05:59.230 --> 06:02.290
J-Just what are you after?

06:02.290 --> 06:04.590
What does any of this accomplish?

06:04.590 --> 06:07.370
Hm? I already told you!

06:07.370 --> 06:10.930
I want to make everyone in the world laugh.

06:11.290 --> 06:16.190
It'd be a waste if I were given these 
amazing powers and didn't use them!

06:16.900 --> 06:20.690
Let's all make a smiling flower bloom!

06:21.220 --> 06:23.530
S-Smiling?

06:23.970 --> 06:28.160
First, Tzveta-chan said she wanted 
to make everyone here smile!

06:28.480 --> 06:33.210
And then eventually, Amarariruku will 
make flowers bloom all over the world!

06:33.210 --> 06:34.620
Like this!

06:34.970 --> 06:36.050
How pretty.

06:36.050 --> 06:39.590
You're even prettier, Tzveta-chan!

06:40.830 --> 06:43.670
I-I won't let you do that!

06:44.360 --> 06:45.360
Huh?

06:46.290 --> 06:50.560
See? You really do like 
getting in people's way.

06:50.560 --> 06:52.930
You're such awful people.

06:53.330 --> 06:56.630
There's no point in trying 
to talk to them, Kufufu-san.

06:56.630 --> 07:01.680
Heroes won't even bother trying 
to think about how we feel.

07:04.840 --> 07:06.740
You know...

07:06.740 --> 07:09.580
You sure have been running 
your mouths long enough.

07:09.920 --> 07:12.330
This is definitely gonna hurt, but...

07:12.330 --> 07:15.850
wake up already!

07:19.060 --> 07:20.250
Pepesha-san!

07:20.250 --> 07:22.180
Teru-chan, don't let your guard down!

07:24.320 --> 07:26.970
I see...

07:27.990 --> 07:31.470
That did wake us up, just a little.

07:32.810 --> 07:36.140
Then I guess your next punishment 
will have to be a bit rougher.

07:37.250 --> 07:38.480
Payback time.

07:39.900 --> 07:40.600
Boo!

07:40.600 --> 07:41.260
Huh?!

07:41.260 --> 07:42.690
Choppy!

07:43.600 --> 07:46.450
Like I'd actually let that happen!

07:50.370 --> 07:54.730
Kufufu-san, continue dealing 
with the shy girl over there.

07:54.730 --> 07:56.330
Tzveta-chan.

07:57.810 --> 07:58.650
I wuv you.

07:58.650 --> 08:00.250
Go, please.

08:00.250 --> 08:02.790
Okee!

08:02.790 --> 08:03.840
D'oh!

08:07.270 --> 08:08.570
You're wide open!

08:08.880 --> 08:12.430
Fly! Hammer!

08:12.430 --> 08:15.310
Enough of your fooling around!

08:17.900 --> 08:19.810
That's some power.

08:20.350 --> 08:21.620
Right?

08:21.620 --> 08:26.520
This is my special attack that 
I thought up while drunk.

08:26.520 --> 08:29.000
It's called Airy Blast.

08:29.000 --> 08:33.330
I can shoot condensed smoke like a cannon.

08:33.330 --> 08:37.120
All the bad little kids tell 
me how much it hurts.

08:37.660 --> 08:39.490
Kufufu-san, are you all right?

08:39.490 --> 08:42.280
You should be. That ice 
cushioned your crash.

08:42.280 --> 08:44.160
Okay, off you go again.

08:44.710 --> 08:47.460
Um, well, Tzveta-chan...

08:48.070 --> 08:49.970
I'm okay, but...

08:49.970 --> 08:53.170
That still hurt a little.

08:53.170 --> 08:56.150
I see. That's too bad. 
I guess you can't, then.

08:56.150 --> 08:57.600
I'm so disappointed in you.

08:57.600 --> 08:59.730
No, hey, wait...

08:59.730 --> 09:03.080
I was hoping I could get 
a little more... love.

09:03.080 --> 09:04.160
Love?

09:04.160 --> 09:07.600
You know, like being a little kinder in 
worrying about me, giving me head pats,

09:07.600 --> 09:11.090
or comforting me so the owies go away!

09:11.090 --> 09:13.330
Go away, owies...

09:13.940 --> 09:15.490
Okay, now you go, too.

09:15.490 --> 09:17.000
Tzveta-chan?!

09:17.000 --> 09:22.760
Now you're just making me seem 
like a burden, and that hurts.

09:22.760 --> 09:23.940
Go.

09:24.700 --> 09:27.680
Why is love so hard?

09:28.390 --> 09:31.490
I-I have no idea how to deal with this...

09:31.920 --> 09:34.430
Teru-chan, back me up.

09:34.430 --> 09:38.020
I want to move everyone who's
 down to somewhere safe.

09:38.020 --> 09:38.810
Huh?

09:39.830 --> 09:44.150
Their attacks are not only unpredictable, 
but they have a huge range.

09:44.150 --> 09:47.460
At this rate, everyone here might 
get caught up in the fighting.

09:48.820 --> 09:52.260
And based on what she said earlier,

09:52.670 --> 09:55.430
I think this whole space 
is negatively affected.

09:55.430 --> 10:00.830
So if we can get them away from this area, 
everyone should wake up.

10:01.470 --> 10:05.350
I'm going to carry everyone beyond that wall.

10:05.350 --> 10:09.090
While I do that, I need you to watch my back.

10:10.630 --> 10:12.630
O-Of course!

10:14.130 --> 10:16.270
I'm counting on you, Shy!

10:16.970 --> 10:19.620
Love, love!

10:21.690 --> 10:24.160
They're getting away! They're getting away!

10:24.160 --> 10:25.500
There's no problem.

10:31.950 --> 10:34.240
I promised we'd carry this together...

10:35.450 --> 10:39.290
Which means... I need to do 
my duty, no matter what!

10:40.830 --> 10:43.080
I won't let you get in her way!

10:43.080 --> 10:45.640
Blazing Stroke!

10:47.170 --> 10:49.960
You fight fire with... water!

10:55.970 --> 10:57.620
JK!

10:57.620 --> 10:59.180
Well said.

10:59.650 --> 11:03.060
Owies, owies... owies.

11:03.060 --> 11:06.190
Tzveta-chan, when you say it that way, 
the owies won't go away.

11:06.540 --> 11:09.190
Wait! They're getting away!

11:10.580 --> 11:12.650
Thanks for the assist, Teru-chan!

11:13.810 --> 11:16.830
Thanks to you, I'll be able to 
get everyone out safely!

11:23.480 --> 11:24.330
Huh?!

11:29.970 --> 11:33.000
This is the inside of my heart.

11:34.180 --> 11:37.130
You won't be able to leave.

11:41.730 --> 11:42.790
Shy.

11:44.520 --> 11:48.020
<u>Kufufu Kekerakera 
Nationality: ???? 
 Likes: Comedies, magic
A member of Amarariruku who 
loves to make people laugh.</u>

11:51.980 --> 11:53.400
Pepesha-san!

11:56.920 --> 11:59.410
It's all stretchy like birdlime! How funny!

11:59.410 --> 12:04.410
B-But why? I know you definitely 
made it through the wall...

12:05.330 --> 12:08.820
I've rejected the outside world.

12:09.170 --> 12:12.630
But that's why the outside world 
has also rejected me.

12:13.300 --> 12:16.700
Anyone who touches the walls of my heart

12:16.700 --> 12:19.090
returns right back to me.

12:20.150 --> 12:23.380
No one may leave or enter this space.

12:24.510 --> 12:29.290
Pesha, a person's heart is 
made up of three components.

12:30.610 --> 12:32.570
First is the world.

12:32.570 --> 12:34.590
Second, emotions.

12:34.590 --> 12:36.600
Third, memories.

12:37.710 --> 12:40.000
The same is true for this space.

12:40.580 --> 12:45.470
The emotions are mine, 
and the world is this place.

12:48.170 --> 12:51.710
The memories are the only thing missing.

12:52.110 --> 12:57.050
That's the only piece I need 
to make my heart complete.

12:57.630 --> 12:59.060
Memories?

12:59.740 --> 13:05.970
That's why we met at the 
North Pole and reunited here.

13:06.810 --> 13:09.480
Why are you telling me this?

13:10.280 --> 13:15.860
Well... The reason I'm blabbing 
everything to you is...

13:16.310 --> 13:20.620
I wanted some time... to prepare my heart.

13:23.230 --> 13:26.870
Let me peek into yours.

13:28.160 --> 13:29.620
Everyone?!

13:32.720 --> 13:33.500
<i>I...</i>

13:33.500 --> 13:34.900
<i>I have to stop them.</i>

13:34.900 --> 13:37.380
I told you that you can't get 
in the way, didn't I?

13:37.380 --> 13:40.100
Things are just getting 
interesting, after all.

13:40.100 --> 13:41.720
Why, you—

13:41.720 --> 13:43.800
Let go of me!

13:46.080 --> 13:52.290
Too bad! This outfit is a totally 
fireproof firefighter uniform!

13:52.290 --> 13:53.900
How do I look?

13:54.820 --> 13:56.310
What did you do to them?

13:57.010 --> 14:01.570
I poured some heart into them... 
My heart, that is.

14:02.370 --> 14:06.220
My heart, which overflows 
throughout this space...

14:06.220 --> 14:09.570
It flowed into their subconscious.

14:10.740 --> 14:16.330
And now, we're connected. 
Our hearts are connected as one.

14:16.640 --> 14:20.850
Connected? You're just 
controlling all of them!

14:21.220 --> 14:24.230
Well, that's an awful way to put it.

14:24.740 --> 14:26.850
They're all me...

14:26.850 --> 14:29.640
And I'm all of them.

14:31.020 --> 14:34.150
Let's all get along... Pesha.

14:36.150 --> 14:37.980
<i>Natalia-san just summoned ice?!</i>

14:37.980 --> 14:40.250
Everyone! Snap out of it!

14:40.250 --> 14:43.950
If I can't get them to snap out of it, 
they'll be under her control forever!

14:43.950 --> 14:46.380
Not true, Pesha.

14:46.700 --> 14:51.080
Pesha, our eyes have been opened.

14:51.080 --> 14:54.210
Rather than the outside world 
that's filled with filth...

14:54.210 --> 14:58.930
We wish to spend eternity 
in this ideal world.

14:58.930 --> 15:02.840
There is no hope in the outside world.

15:02.840 --> 15:06.220
Only youth can save us.

15:06.630 --> 15:09.730
Maturity means defeat.

15:12.590 --> 15:13.830
Pesha.

15:13.830 --> 15:16.270
Let's live here together.

15:16.270 --> 15:19.560
All that exists in the outside world is pain.

15:19.560 --> 15:24.740
The children that I've loved are 
disappearing into the heartless reality.

15:24.740 --> 15:26.100
Sir...

15:28.100 --> 15:30.130
It's cold outside.

15:30.130 --> 15:32.460
It's warm in our home.

15:32.460 --> 15:34.660
I don't like pain.

15:34.660 --> 15:36.900
I want to be happy.

15:36.900 --> 15:39.990
Yes, we're all the same.

15:40.500 --> 15:46.290
There's no point in departing 
on a journey just to seek pain.

15:46.290 --> 15:51.510
We're all going to live together 
in warmth right here.

15:51.510 --> 15:53.710
E-Everyone...

15:54.130 --> 15:57.750
See? You heard what they said.

15:58.150 --> 16:02.140
Don't you feel the same way... Pesha?

16:02.510 --> 16:04.710
You're just making them say all that!

16:05.620 --> 16:10.460
What are you talking about? 
That's just how they really feel inside.

16:10.460 --> 16:14.410
I can tell. We're connected, after all.

16:15.910 --> 16:17.980
Pepesha-san! Look out!

16:20.200 --> 16:21.750
Wh-What can I do?

16:25.000 --> 16:30.800
Only this warm place can 
bring us true peace...

16:32.140 --> 16:33.850
She's shaking...

16:35.890 --> 16:39.100
I want you to be with us here, too.

16:39.780 --> 16:41.300
I'm scared...

16:45.310 --> 16:50.950
I'm happy! I'm so happy! 
Because I don't have to think about anything!

16:51.610 --> 16:56.390
I'm cold... Save me... Someone...

17:01.930 --> 17:04.750
Tzveta!

17:08.680 --> 17:12.260
What do you think people's hearts are?!

17:12.640 --> 17:14.810
Pepesha-san, calm down!

17:14.810 --> 17:18.770
Nope! If she calms down, 
it's gonna kill the whole mood.

17:19.790 --> 17:22.320
<i>What is this? Something's wrong...</i>

17:22.640 --> 17:25.750
<i>She's also not doing anything else...</i>

17:26.160 --> 17:30.160
<i>And all the words coming out of everyone 
being controlled have been unnatural.</i>

17:31.120 --> 17:35.180
<i>It's like she's trying to make Pepesha-san mad.</i>

17:37.380 --> 17:44.370
In between your aggressively wavering 
emotions... I can get a glimpse of your life.

17:45.550 --> 17:50.050
I've been waiting this whole
 time for you to get angry.

17:52.100 --> 17:54.720
Pepesha-san! Get away from her! She's—

17:55.870 --> 17:58.720
<i>Is she absorbing the power from my heart?</i>

18:00.210 --> 18:01.930
<i>But that's—</i>

18:01.930 --> 18:05.060
On a cold, cold winter's night...

18:05.810 --> 18:08.400
Pesha's tiny hand...

18:13.840 --> 18:23.040
I can see your tiny hand weakly 
gripping my ice-cold hand...

18:23.640 --> 18:27.190
If you touch this hand, they'll come back...

18:29.460 --> 18:33.140
The missing pieces of my memories...

18:33.140 --> 18:36.690
Ah, I'm starting to remember them.

18:52.670 --> 18:56.260
The candle that just wouldn't 
light on shivering nights...

18:56.260 --> 18:59.250
The moon that looked down 
upon us from the night sky...

18:59.810 --> 19:02.790
The lake that seemed like an abyss...

19:03.090 --> 19:08.270
Hey, why? Why did everyone lie to me?

19:08.790 --> 19:11.920
I believed in all of you.

19:13.120 --> 19:15.880
But the outside world is just so...

19:16.910 --> 19:19.050
full of shit!

19:34.530 --> 19:38.450
<i>I love this place.</i>

19:49.870 --> 19:52.340
Smile, Lenya!

19:58.020 --> 20:00.450
May you find happiness.

20:01.430 --> 20:03.290
Have a wonderful life.

20:08.500 --> 20:11.790
<i>But I was told that the outside world</i>

20:11.790 --> 20:16.440
<i>was overflowing with even more 
wonderful things worth loving.</i>

20:17.300 --> 20:19.450
<i>I wanted to find them...</i>

20:20.600 --> 20:22.920
<i>So I departed excitedly.</i>

20:34.160 --> 20:38.340
"Babies love their mother's smile"?

20:54.000 --> 20:58.840
Welcome... my precious...

21:19.150 --> 21:22.350
<i>The wonderful things in the outside world...</i>

21:28.000 --> 21:31.420
<i>Tell me... What exactly...</i>

21:34.530 --> 21:36.750
<i>were those supposed to be?</i>

21:42.580 --> 21:46.160
<i>Ah... It's so cold.</i>

21:52.590 --> 21:53.950
Mama...

21:58.550 --> 22:00.220
Pepesha-san!
